PostgreSQL is an open-source object-relational database system.
The PostgreSQL data source plugin lets Grafana query, visualize, and alert
on data stored in PostgreSQL or PostgreSQL-compatible databases
(for example TimescaleDB).

To install this plugin, do
# ln -s /usr/pkg/share/grafana/plugins/grafana-postgresql-datasource \
    /var/lib/grafana/plugins

Ensure the following settings are present in grafana's configuration file:
[plugins]
preinstall_disabled = true
preinstall_auto_update = false
allow_loading_unsigned_plugins = grafana-postgresql-datasource

[plugin.grafana-postgresql-datasource]
as_external = true
